node_modules
# `dist` is NOT excluded: docker/web.Dockerfile's WEB_SRC=prebuilt path copies it from the context,
# so that `/flashdeploy` can ship the bundle its local guard already built instead of building it a
# second time inside the image. The default (WEB_SRC=build) ignores whatever copy rode along and
# regenerates it in the image, so a stale local dist/ cannot reach a release.
.vite
*.log
